                                "sense_id": "b6624745-d600-3703-8304-595818d5f541",
                                "text": "SANDY: Oh, get him! The vanity of the man. Well, p'raps not Nelson then. How about reproductions of great masterpieces?\nJULIAN: A bona idea. Now, let me see..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e1c8e8f-3f3f-4f74-93fd-0d887719714f",
                                "sense_id": "b6624745-d600-3703-8304-595818d5f541",
                                "text": "Will you take a varder at the cartz on the feely-omi in the naf strides: the one with the bona blue ogles polarying the omi-palone with a vogue on and a cod sheitel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca2d8540-bc7a-467c-98e3-49aa569e8845",
                                "sense_id": "b6624745-d600-3703-8304-595818d5f541",
                                "text": "Bona to vada you."
